  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Danyiwe Departmental Women Shea Butter Producers&apos; Expansion Project</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Cooprative Danyiw is a cooperative composed of female shea butter producers. They produce and market conventional and organic shea butter both locally and internationally. Through this project, the Cooperative plans to better meet customer demands and solve their limited storage space issue for the raw nuts and their finished product therefore increasing their shea butter productions, sales revenues, and improve livelihoods.</narrative>
  </description>
